## Erlang VM flags for the Conveyor release.
##
## Schedulers do not busy-wait: at 1,000 idle-ish BES streams the BEAM showed >100 % OS
## CPU with under 1 % real scheduler utilization (M7 measurement). Spinning wastes cloud
## vCPUs and fools CPU-based autoscalers (the Kubernetes HPA scales on CPU); the latency
## cost is microseconds against a 250 ms ack budget.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

## Bazel opens one HTTP/2 connection per build; leave headroom for many.
+Q 1048576
